  content_en: "Yesterday was a very emotional day for Mia and her friends. In the morning, Mia was worried because she could not find her homework. Her brother Leo was angry because someone took his pencil. Their mum was calm and helped them both look. Mia was relieved when she found the homework inside her bag. At school, the class was excited because there was a special surprise visitor. When the visitor walked in, everyone was surprised — it was a famous author! During the long talk, some students were bored because the author spoke very slowly. After the talk, the teacher gave everyone a snack. The children were hungry and thirsty after sitting for so long. By lunchtime, the whole class was cheerful and excited again. Leo was still a little upset because no one found his pencil. At the end of the day, Mia was tired but happy. She told her mum: \"I was scared when I lost my homework, but I was relieved when I found it. Then I was excited to meet the author, but tired by the end. What an emotional day!\"",
